#   parser_3 - the CSS parser: declarations and the "parse a ..." entry points
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/Parser.cpp (lines 1173-1628): consume a declaration and the
#       remnants of a bad one; parse a rule, a block's contents, a declaration, a component
#       value, a (comma-separated) list of component values; and the CSSOM's "parse a CSS
#       declaration block" for properties and for descriptors.
